# Rehearsal / ops harness for SportsbookMarket v1.10 + SportsbookFactory v1.5.
# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored — never commit real keys.

# ── RPC ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Base mainnet endpoint. Use Alchemy (or another paid provider), NOT a public RPC.
# During the v1.10 launch all four public endpoints failed in different ways:
#   publicnode  — refuses eth_getTransactionReceipt ("archive request"), so a write
#                 lands and the script then dies reading its own receipt
#   base.org    — "over rate limit" mid-run
#   drpc        — "Unknown block" on a pinned read just after a confirmed tx
#   1rpc        — eth_getLogs capped at 50 blocks
# Resolution order: MAINNET_RPC > ALCHEMY_RPC_URL > ALCHEMY_KEY > public fallback.
ALCHEMY_RPC_URL=https://base-mainnet.g.alchemy.com/v2/YOUR_ALCHEMY_KEY
# ALCHEMY_KEY=YOUR_ALCHEMY_KEY          # alternative to the full URL
# MAINNET_RPC=                          # explicit override, wins over both

# NOTE: the current Alchemy account is Free tier, which caps eth_getLogs at a
# 10-BLOCK range — narrower than the public endpoints. Nothing here uses getLogs
# (events come from transaction receipts); check the tier before adding any.

# ── Keys ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Base Sepolia key for the rehearsal harness (sepolia-rehearsal.mjs).
SEPOLIA_PRIVATE_KEY=0xYOUR_SEPOLIA_TEST_KEY

# Production wallet key — ONLY needed while actually deploying or settling.
# Remove it from .env once the operation is done; do not leave it on disk.
# MAINNET_PRIVATE_KEY=0xYOUR_PRODUCTION_WALLET_KEY

# ── BaseScan verification (optional) ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Needed to submit contract verification programmatically. Get one at basescan.org.
# BASESCAN_API_KEY=YOUR_BASESCAN_API_KEY

# ── Base Sepolia RPC (rehearsal only) ────────────────────────────────────────
# SEPOLIA_RPC=https://sepolia.base.org
